**ES Command Center**

Project Documentation & Design Reference

*Freeman Exhibitor Services  ·  Version 36.24  ·  May 22, 2026*

# **1.  Project Overview**

The ES Command Center is a web-based leadership dashboard built for Freeman Exhibitor Services leaders. It surfaces real-time operational intelligence, compliance deadlines, and actionable workspaces across all 9 Leader Resource responsibility areas.

| **Property** | **Value** |
| --- | --- |
| **Live URL** | https://cwgaibler.github.io/ES_Command_Center/ |
| **GitHub Repo** | https://github.com/CWGaibler/ES_Command_Center |
| **Stack** | index.html (lean shell) + data/ folder. Vanilla JavaScript. No framework. GitHub Pages hosting. |
| **Auth** | SHA-256 passphrase gate. Upgrade to Okta/SharePoint SSO before broader rollout. |
| **Storage version** | STORAGE_VERSION = 4. Version bump triggers full data reset for all users. |
| **Data** | 4,449 SHOWS │ 301 TEAM_MEMBERS │ 429 SURVEY_DATA records |
| **Org** | 7 regions, 18 branches — scope selector is the universal data lens |

